# Exceptions for scripts/check-docs.sh, one `file:target` per line.
# `file:target@LINE` skips one target on one line; `file:target` skips it
# everywhere in the file; `file:*` skips the backticked-path rule (rule d) for
# that whole file. Prefer the per-line form.
# Keep this list small; every entry needs a reason.

# Research notes cite paths inside other people's repositories (CloakPipe,
# pii-shield, GLiNER, ...) as evidence. They are not paths in this repository.
docs/research/2026-09-27-prior-art.md:*
docs/research/2026-09-27-latency-scan.md:*
